==Battleground==
*10 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~14 seconds<sup>120f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 50~80 seconds<sup>1,500f~2,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 15 seconds<sup>450f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 60~100 seconds<sup>1,800f~3,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 50~80 seconds<sup>1,500f~2,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 20~36 seconds<sup>600f~1,080f</sup>.
**8 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.
**2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 12~18 seconds<sup>360f~540f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage isn't too difficult, as the initial Gories and Kang Roos give you plenty of money to spam Cameraman, Paris/Cyborg or Drama Cats. If you are still struggling with the Gory Darks or Shadow Boxer Ks, you can bring anti-Dark units such as Flower Cat (Bombercat is ideal, but Flower works just fine) and Cat Gunslinger to help reduce their pushing power, Weightlifter Cat to completely annihilate any Dark enemy up close, along with bringing more meatshields to give those enemies more to push through.

